  "bio": {
    "mode": "video",
    "video": "media/bio-bg-caduceus-wide.mp4",
    "image": "media/bio-bg-caduceus-wide.jpg",
    "poster": "media/bio-bg-caduceus-wide.jpg",
    "quote": "I'm Telephantix, The Arcane Verse. I'm an ex-trucker from Western Pennsylvania, and these days my hours go into building.\n\nMost days start with music. I lay down my own original beds first, the bass, the power chords and the pulse, then build them out into full Telephantix songs with Suno. Then the songs get eyes. I make music videos for them, like Nobility's Plight, where Goku and Thor settle it the hard way. After that I build games, like The Unburied, my dark action RPG.\n\nI love working with AI, or SI as I like to call it. I run a crew of bots: Agent Alpha on music, The Verse on lyrics, Atlas on art and Hephaestus on code and this site. I set the direction and they help me build it.\n\nI believe in correspondence, as above, so below, and in humility before divine order. I believe in free speech, the free market and good intentions. Government has a real role in keeping people safe and maintaining order. I believe in a strong defense, both to stop anyone from building an unfair system or oppressive policy and to guard against threats foreign and domestic. Oil production is being strained beyond repair, and I think the government should back new energy technology wherever it's in development.\n\nNo label, no studio, no investors. I'm still building, hoping to make a better future for myself. If something here reached you, tap Pay below and help me build what's next.",
    "quoteBy": "Telephantix",
    "muted": true
  },
